# ─── Locally-captured artifacts the harness/sandbox may dump ───
# Stub demo fixtures (small JSON) are intentionally checked in.
# Use the `.recorded.` infix for one-off live captures you don't want to commit.
fixtures/**/*.recorded.json
fixtures/**/*.recorded.png
fixtures/screenshots/*.png
fixtures/screenshots/*.jpg
!fixtures/**/.gitkeep

